# Web (`apps/web/src`)

```text
src/
  app/          RSC (busca, lista, dados iniciais)
  api/          serviços HTTP (trips, reservations, payments)
  components/   UI
  context/      providers (TanStack Query)
  hooks/        react-query hooks
  schemas/      Zod
  types/        tipos de domínio
  lib/          format helpers
```

- Só fala com `api-gateway` (`NEXT_PUBLIC_API_GATEWAY_URL` / `API_GATEWAY_URL`)
- Busca: RHF + Zod · Reserva: TanStack Query
- `Idempotency-Key` em reserve e pay
